nsactions smoothly and configured automated flow regression testing via Playwright.\",\"link\":\"\"}],\"education\":[{\"degree\":\"B.E. in Computer Science and Engineering\",\"institution\":\"PSN College of Engineering and Technology (Anna University), Tirunelveli\",\"date\":\"Apr 2026\",\"gpa\":\"7.99\"}]}', '2026-08-01 12:33:00'),
