(4, 1, 'Target Company', 'Target Role', 'Job description\nHiring a Full Stack Engineer with expertise in React, FastAPI/Python, TypeScript, AWS, Kubernetes, Docker, REST APIs, SQL, and AI-assisted development to build secure, scalable, cloud-native web applications end-to-end.\n\nRequired Candidate profile\n\nLooking for a Full Stack Engineer with strong React, Python/FastAPI, AWS, Kubernetes, SQL, API, and AI coding tool experience, with solid problem-solving and secure coding skills.\nRole: Full Stack Developer\nIndustry Type: IT Services & Consulting\nDepartment: Engineering - Software & QA\nEmployment Type: Full Time, Permanent\nRole Category: Software Development\nEducation\nUG: B.Tech / B.E. in Computer Science and Engineering (CSE), Information Technology\nKey Skills\nSkills highlighted with ‘‘ are preferred keyskills\nReact.jsAI Coding ToolsSQLPython (FastAPI/Flask)Kubernetes & Docker\nTypeScriptGit/GitHubAWS Cloud ServicesFull Stack', 92, '{\"personalInfo\":{\"name\":\"SIVAKUMAR SELVARAJ\",\"headline\":\"Full Stack Engineer\",\"email\":\"sivakumarselvaraj1008@gmail.com\",\"phone\":\"+91 9361343013\",\"location\":\"Thiruthangal, Virudhunagar - 626130\",\"links\":{\"linkedin\":\"www.linkedin.com/in/sivakumarselvaraj2003\",\"github\":\"github.com/SivakumarSelvaraj2003\",\"portfolio\":\"sivakumarselvaraj2003.github.io/My-Portfolio\"}},\"summary\":\"Performance-focused Full Stack Engineer specializing in modern JavaScript ecosystems, React.js, Node.js, and SQL databases to build secure, scalable web applications end-to-end. Experienced in architecting RESTful APIs, integrating AI-driven systems such as Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) platforms, and optimizing performance across full-stack applications. Proven track record of rapid progression and delivering production-ready software solutions with strong problem-solving skills.\",\"skills\":[\"React.js\",\"REST API Development\",\"MySQL\",\"Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG)\",\"Node.js\",\"Express.js\",\